under the existing active `Finalizer` condition.\n\nVerification with the required GraalVM:\n\n- `./gradlew test -Pcoordinates=org.apache.curator:curator-client:5.0.0` — passed, all 33 native tests successful.\n- `git diff --check` — passed.\n- JSON validation — passed.\n- `fissile check --staged` — passed.\n\nThe exact trace command reports Gradle success but its trace-enabled binary still exits `1` during JUnit discovery with a GraalVM metadata-tracing `StackOverflowError`; the ordinary native test binary passes completely. `checkMetadataFiles` also reports pre-existing test-package conditions outside the configured `org.apache.curator` package.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_099385eea51a0533016abe49d2448c87d2b566733ebd1b3c6a\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 1315, "output": 707, "cacheRead": 168320, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 516, "totalTokens": 170342, "cost": {"input": 0.00526, "output": 0.014140000000000002, "cacheRead": 0.067328, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.086728}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1790855622404, "responseId": "resp_099385eea51a0533016abe49c69e2887d2b1873f3ce1bfcac0", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
  
