ry`. Check the 5.0.0 jar for the actual public API before writing code. Keep the existing ZooKeeper dependency in `build.gradle`, bumped to a version compatible with curator-client 5.0.0 (ZooKeeper 3.6.x line) if the build does not already resolve it transitively.\",\n      \"risks\": [\n        \"The 5.0.0 API removal list is inferred only from the compile errors shown in the truncated log. More missing symbols may appear after the first set is fixed.\",\n        \"Dropping the Exhibitor tests may reduce dynamic-access coverage relative to 2.7.1, if those tests exercised reflective access.\",\n        \"curator-client 5.0.0 pulls in ZooKeeper 3.6.x, which may add transitive dependencies or require reflection metadata not present for 2.7.1.\"\n      ],\n      \"applied_setup\": [],\n      \"input_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"issue\",\n          \"summary\": \"#9364 [Automation] javac compile fails for org.apache.curator:curator-client:5.0.0; label=fails-javac-compile; body_chars=8015\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"existing_tests\",\n          \"summary\": \"7 existing test file path(s) included\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"current_library\": \"org.apache.curator:curator-client:2.7.1\",\n      \"new_version\": \"5.0.0\",\n      \"model\": \"sonnet\",\n      \"input_tokens_used\": 2,\n      \"output_tokens_used\": 1140\n    },\n    \"metrics\": {\n      \"input_tokens_used\": 65989,\n      \"cached_input_tokens_used\": 628736,\n      \"output_tokens_used\": 4192,\n      \"iterations\": 4,\n      \"cost_usd\": 0.1541,\n      \"tested_library_loc\": 439,\n      \"metadata_entries\": 1,\n      \"previous_library_metadata_entries\": 1,\n      \"code_coverage_percent\": 1.17,\n      \"previous_library_coverage_percent\": 53.54\n    },\n    \"artifacts\": {\n      \"metadata_file\": \"metadata/org.apache.curator/curator-client/5.0.0/reachability-metadata.json\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1790856425719}}
